{"page":28,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:182","surah":2,"ayah":182,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَنْ خَافَ مِن مُّوصٍ جَنَفًا أَوْ إِثْمًا فَأَصْلَحَ بَيْنَهُمْ فَلَآ إِثْمَ عَلَيْهِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if anyone knows that the testator has made a mistake, or done wrong, and so puts things right between the parties, he will incur no sin: God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"But whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَافَ","en_gloss":"fears","transliteration":"khāfa","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُّوصٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) testator","transliteration":"mūṣin","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَنَفًا","en_gloss":"(any) error","transliteration":"janafan","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِثْمًۭا","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"ith'man","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَأَصْلَحَ","en_gloss":"then reconciles","transliteration":"fa-aṣlaḥa","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلَآ","en_gloss":"then (there is) no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِثْمَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"ith'ma","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"2:182"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٨٢","en_gloss":"(182)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:182"}]},{"verse_key":"2:183","surah":2,"ayah":183,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ كُتِبَ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلصِّيَامُ كَمَا كُتِبَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, fasting is prescribed for you, as it was prescribed for those before you, so that you may be mindful of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُتِبَ","en_gloss":"Is prescribed","transliteration":"kutiba","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلصِّيَامُ","en_gloss":"[the] fasting","transliteration":"l-ṣiyāmu","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُتِبَ","en_gloss":"was prescribed","transliteration":"kutiba","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"(become) righteous","transliteration":"tattaqūna","verse_key":"2:183"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٨٣","en_gloss":"(183)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:183"}]},{"verse_key":"2:184","surah":2,"ayah":184,"ar_uthmani":"أَيَّامًا مَّعْدُودَٰتٍ ۚ فَمَن كَانَ مِنكُم مَّرِيضًا أَوْ عَلَىٰ سَفَرٍ فَعِدَّةٌ مِّنْ أَيَّامٍ أُخَرَ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ يُطِيقُونَهُۥ فِدْيَةٌ طَعَامُ مِسْكِينٍ ۖ فَمَن تَطَوَّعَ خَيْرًا فَهُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّهُۥ ۚ وَأَن تَصُومُوا۟ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ۖ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Fast for a specific number of days, but if one of you is ill, or on a journey, on other days later. For those who can fast only with extreme difficulty, there is a way to compensate- feed a needy person. But if anyone does good of his own accord, it is better for him, and fasting is better for you, if only you knew.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَيَّامًۭا","en_gloss":"(Fasting for) days","transliteration":"ayyāman","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّعْدُودَٰتٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"numbered","transliteration":"maʿdūdātin","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنكُم","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَّرِيضًا","en_gloss":"sick","transliteration":"marīḍan","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَفَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a journey","transliteration":"safarin","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَعِدَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"then a prescribed number","transliteration":"faʿiddatun","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَيَّامٍ","en_gloss":"days","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُخَرَ ۚ","en_gloss":"other","transliteration":"ukhara","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُطِيقُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"can afford it","transliteration":"yuṭīqūnahu","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِدْيَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a ransom","transliteration":"fid'yatun","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":18,"ar":"طَعَامُ","en_gloss":"(of) feeding","transliteration":"ṭaʿāmu","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مِسْكِينٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"a poor","transliteration":"mis'kīnin","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":21,"ar":"تَطَوَّعَ","en_gloss":"volunteers","transliteration":"taṭawwaʿa","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":22,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"then it","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":24,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":25,"ar":"لَّهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَأَن","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-an","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":27,"ar":"تَصُومُوا۟","en_gloss":"fast","transliteration":"taṣūmū","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":28,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":29,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":30,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":31,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":32,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:184"},{"pos":33,"ar":"١٨٤","en_gloss":"(184)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:184"}]},{"verse_key":"2:185","surah":2,"ayah":185,"ar_uthmani":"شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ فِيهِ ٱلْقُرْءَانُ هُدًى لِّلنَّاسِ وَبَيِّنَـٰتٍ مِّنَ ٱلْهُدَىٰ وَٱلْفُرْقَانِ ۚ فَمَن شَهِدَ مِنكُمُ ٱلشَّهْرَ فَلْيَصُمْهُ ۖ وَمَن كَانَ مَرِيضًا أَوْ عَلَىٰ سَفَرٍ فَعِدَّةٌ مِّنْ أَيَّامٍ أُخَرَ ۗ يُرِيدُ ٱللَّهُ بِكُمُ ٱلْيُسْرَ وَلَا يُرِيدُ بِكُمُ ٱلْعُسْرَ وَلِتُكْمِلُوا۟ ٱلْعِدَّةَ وَلِتُكَبِّرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ مَا هَدَىٰكُمْ وَلَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was in the month of Ramadan that the Quran was revealed as guidance for mankind, clear messages giving guidance and distinguishing between right and wrong. So any one of you who is present that month should fast, and anyone who is ill or on a journey should make up for the lost days by fasting on other days later. God wants ease for you, not hardship. He wants you to complete the prescribed period and to glorify Him for having guided you, so that you may be thankful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"شَهْرُ","en_gloss":"Month","transliteration":"shahru","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَمَضَانَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ramadhaan","transliteration":"ramaḍāna","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) that","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'ānu","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُدًۭى","en_gloss":"a Guidance","transliteration":"hudan","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِّلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"and clear proofs","transliteration":"wabayyinātin","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"[the] Guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْفُرْقَانِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the Criterion","transliteration":"wal-fur'qāni","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:185"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَهِدَ","en_gloss":"witnesses","transliteration":"shahida","verse_k